{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"a66efe60-08ac-41e4-ad38-37a639ee4ef6","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Updated [deploy.sh](file:///tmp/h-k5ICUQ/deploy.sh) and documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-k5ICUQ/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Static Files (`sync_site` in [deploy.sh](file:///tmp/h-k5ICUQ/deploy.sh#L14-L17))**:\n   - Added `--delete` to remove any files from the S3 bucket that have been removed from `site/`.\n   - Added `--exclude \"s/*\" --exclude \"a/*\"` so that syncing static site assets does not delete generated note and author pages.\n\n2. **Generated Pages (`upload_pages` in [deploy.sh](file:///tmp/h-k5ICUQ/deploy.sh#L19-L27))**:\n   - Switched from iterating with `aws s3 cp` to using `aws s3 sync \"$ROOT/.build/pages/\" \"s3://$BUCKET/\" --delete`.\n   - Added `--exclude \"*\" --include \"s/*\" --include \"a/*\"` so deletions and uploads are scoped strictly to note (`s/*`) and author (`a/*`) pages without affecting static root assets.\n   - Retained `--content-type \"text/html; charset=utf-8\"` and `--cache-control \"max-age=300\"` for prerendered pages.\n","duration_seconds":59.42848,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":146726,"output_tokens":1923,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":144398,"total_tokens":148649}}}
